、\n 特にネギが苦手でした。\n お鍋のネギも食べられないし、\n 焼き鳥のねぎまも「ま」しか食べられませんでした。\n \n そんなネギも最近は美味しく味わって食べます、、。\n 大人になったな〜\n \n しかしです、\n ミョウガだけはいまだに食べられないのです。\n ミョウガが食べられたら私の舌は\n 完全なる大人を迎えたということになりますね。\n また味覚の近況報告させていただきますね。\n \n \n 佐々木久美です。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38XN5NRBKHE03DB1XS217S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 日曜日は京都で個別握手会でした！\n \n \n 🐡1・2部\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38XP79DWWAQ3N7X72SE1JW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38XQ7HRXYF82HFJVWC1SFG","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 「山の上の神社まで少し寒いけど初詣に行こう⛩」\n コーデです。\n 流石に寒いかな、？？アウター貸してください😚\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38XR6M4N4Z2TE592XT4WXJ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 2部は前髪流し〜\n \n 帽子：メチャカリ\n トップス:Dholic\n パンツ:UNE MANSION\n \n このパンツ、とーーーっても形が好きで\n お気に入りです！！たくさん履いてる〜\n \n \n 🐡3部\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38XS6WDWFNR3MNYHNJGKKQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n 「暇だし、テーマパークデートしよ！」\n コーデです！一番オキニのカチューシャつけました！\n おまけでかわい子ちゃんついてきました🍞\n \n \n 🐡4・5部\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38XT7ETHB1G83G718ASA7M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38XV7AS4P2XAT0T0F5STP8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n 「やっぱりパーカーが一番だよね」コーデです。\n \n 最近ライブにもいかせていただいた\n CreepyNutsさんのパーカー着ました🍩\n とっても痺れたライブでした、、、、\n 心の底が震えました。\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38XW63M87455JJXY2YYHWB","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n ヒップホップのノリ方に憧れた結果このポーズ🕺\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38XX93ZRY7NP6241VS5A18","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38XYASH81TKAXZYQTVKXE5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38XZACZFNNRR90RGSPWXF6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38Y0CJG6S781S9NSCJC2S5","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n たくさんありがとうございます😭\n お花に込められた思い、しかと受け取りました。\n \n \n \n \n 実はハーフツインとっても久しぶりにしました。\n アイドル1年目はライブでよくやっていたのですが、\n 懐かしい気持ちになりました〜\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ38Y1D211HZ5Y1D39CSMWM1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n ではまたね( ˙-˙ )/\n \n 佐々木久美"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-17965":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりんごっ(o・・o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"対バンだっ！！\n喧嘩上等っ！！！\n楽しかった！！\n氣志團さんのおもてなし\n日本代表級っ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛羅武勇！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2014/04/16/7406616/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tシャツだーー！！！\n夜露死苦！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"詳しくはまた後日\\( ˆoˆ )/\n疲れたから寝るぜっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雄野図味っ\\( ˆoˆ )/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/sayuri.matsumura/img/2014/04/16/7406616/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Tシャツ着てないのに\nまいちゃんのおかげで\nきてるように見えるぜーヾ(＠⌒ー⌒＠)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沙友林檎っ(o・・o)！"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-1290":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.matsumura/img/blog/phot